      "description": "Watch Heerenveen vs PEC Zwolle highlights and goals from Eredivisie on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 22, 2026. The atmosphere at the Abe Lenstra was electric as both teams prepared for a pivotal Eredivisie showdown. Under the stadium lights, both sides were eager to dictate the pace from the very first whistle. Intensity and Tactical Battles On August 22, 2026, the match opened with both teams testing each other through set pieces. SC Heerenveen , buoyed by their home crowd, sought to control possession, but PEC Zwolle remained disciplined. The first half was defined by hard-fought midfield battles, with Ryan Thomas receiving a yellow card for diving, highlighting the high stakes of the encounter. A Second Half Spark The game exploded into life after the break. In the 50th minute, Nick Viergever tapped home from a Dylan Mbayo assist to give PEC Zwolle the lead. SC Heerenveen fought back immediately, and in the 61st minute, Koen Kostons leveled the score with a clinical left-footed finish. The closing stages were defined by intense tactical adjustments and a dramatic VAR intervention, which overturned a late goal for the visitors in the 84th minute due to offside, cementing a hard-fought draw before a crowd of 21,900."
